#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:2
msgid "Know why the model stopped"
msgstr "了解模型为什么停下"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:4
msgid "A request ends when the model has nothing more to ask for. That is not the same as the model *finishing*. It may have refused, run into its output limit, filled the context window, or lost its connection halfway through a sentence. Providers report each of these differently, and a program that only looks for tool calls sees all of them as \"the model answered\"."
msgstr "当模型没有更多要请求的东西时，请求就结束了。这与模型*完成*回答不是一回事：它可能拒绝了，可能撞上了输出上限，可能填满了上下文窗口，也可能在句子说到一半时断开了连接。各个提供方报告这些情况的方式都不同，而只检查工具调用的程序会把它们全部看成“模型回答了”。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:10
msgid "Zett Agent reads every provider's report into one vocabulary and puts it where a host can see it, instead of dropping it."
msgstr "Zett Agent 会把每个提供方的报告读成同一套词汇，并放到宿主能看见的地方，而不是把它丢掉。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:14
msgid "Check how it ended"
msgstr "检查它是怎么结束的"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:16
msgid "An abnormal stop is on the message the run returns:"
msgstr "非正常停止会记录在运行返回的消息上："

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:26
msgid "``message.stop`` is ``None`` when the model finished or asked for tools, which includes every message stored before this existed. When it is set it is a :class:`~zett_agent.stop.StopInfo`:"
msgstr "当模型正常结束或请求了工具时，``message.stop`` 为 ``None``，这也包括在此功能出现之前存储的所有消息。设置了它时，它是一个 :class:`~zett_agent.stop.StopInfo`："

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:34
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:35 ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:85
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:36
msgid "``reason``"
msgstr "``reason``"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:37
msgid "The normalized :class:`~zett_agent.stop.StopReason`. Branch on this."
msgstr "归一化后的 :class:`~zett_agent.stop.StopReason`\\ 。请依据它来分支处理。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:38
msgid "``raw``"
msgstr "``raw``"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:39
msgid "The provider's own value, unchanged, such as ``\"content_filter\"``."
msgstr "提供方自己的取值，原样保留，例如 ``\"content_filter\"``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:40
msgid "``category``"
msgstr "``category``"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:41
msgid "What kind: the provider's policy category (``\"cyber\"``, ``\"SAFETY\"``) or, if it has none, the raw value."
msgstr "类别：提供方的策略类别（``\"cyber\"``、``\"SAFETY\"``）；如果提供方没有给出，则为原始取值。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:42
msgid "``message``"
msgstr "``message``"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:43
msgid "A sentence for a person: the refusal text, or the provider's explanation. Show it; do not parse it."
msgstr "给人看的一句话：拒绝文本或提供方的解释。请展示它，不要解析它。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:44
msgid "``recommended_model``"
msgstr "``recommended_model``"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:45
msgid "A model the provider suggests retrying on, when it does."
msgstr "提供方建议改用重试的模型（如果它给出了的话）。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:46
msgid "``detail``"
msgstr "``detail``"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:47
msgid "Provider-specific facts with no normalized home, such as an OpenRouter ``native_finish_reason`` or the names of tool calls that were withheld."
msgstr "没有归一化位置的提供方特有信息，例如 OpenRouter 的 ``native_finish_reason``，或被扣下的工具调用的名称。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:49
msgid "Scripts can ask to be told instead of checking:"
msgstr "脚本可以选择被通知，而不是自己检查："

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:55
msgid "The runtime never raises it for you. A refusal is a normal outcome, so a host that does not look still gets the conversation back."
msgstr "运行时绝不会替你抛出它。拒绝是一种正常结果，所以不去检查的宿主依然能拿回对话。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:59
msgid "Hear about it as it happens"
msgstr "在它发生时就得知"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:61
msgid "A streaming UI gets a ``MODEL_STOPPED`` event right after ``MODEL_COMPLETED``. It is sent only for an abnormal stop, so there is nothing to filter:"
msgstr "流式 UI 会在 ``MODEL_COMPLETED`` 之后立即收到一个 ``MODEL_STOPPED`` 事件。它只在非正常停止时发送，所以无需过滤："

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:70
msgid "With an :class:`~zett_agent.dispatcher.AgentEventDispatcher`, override ``on_model_stopped_event``. An extension sees the same value as ``response.stop`` in ``after_model``."
msgstr "使用 :class:`~zett_agent.dispatcher.AgentEventDispatcher` 时，请重写 ``on_model_stopped_event``\\ 。扩展在 ``after_model`` 中看到的是同一个值，即 ``response.stop``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:74
msgid "``RUN_COMPLETED`` still follows. It means the request ran to its end, and a refusal ends a request and completes it; ``MODEL_STOPPED`` is how you tell the two apart."
msgstr "``RUN_COMPLETED`` 仍然会随后到来。它表示请求运行到了结尾，而拒绝会结束并完成一次请求；要区分这两种情况，就靠 ``MODEL_STOPPED``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:78
msgid "What each reason means"
msgstr "各个原因的含义"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:84
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "原因"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:86
msgid "What the runtime does"
msgstr "运行时会怎么做"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:87
msgid "``END_TURN``"
msgstr "``END_TURN``"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:88
msgid "The model finished, or hit a stop sequence you set."
msgstr "模型完成了回答，或遇到了你设置的停止序列。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:89
msgid "Nothing; not reported."
msgstr "什么也不做；不上报。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:90
msgid "``TOOL_USE``"
msgstr "``TOOL_USE``"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:91
msgid "The model asked for tools."
msgstr "模型请求了工具。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:92
msgid "Runs them; not reported."
msgstr "运行这些工具；不上报。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:93
msgid "``MAX_OUTPUT``"
msgstr "``MAX_OUTPUT``"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:94
msgid "The output limit was reached. Text, or a tool call's arguments, is cut off."
msgstr "达到了输出上限。文本，或某个工具调用的参数，被截断了。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:95
msgid "Reports it. A tool call with cut-off arguments is answered with an error, as before."
msgstr "上报它。参数被截断的工具调用会像以前一样得到一个错误作为回应。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:96
msgid "``CONTEXT_FULL``"
msgstr "``CONTEXT_FULL``"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:97
msgid "The context window filled. The output is cut off."
msgstr "上下文窗口被填满了。输出被截断。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:98
msgid "Reports it."
msgstr "上报它。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:99
msgid "``REFUSAL``"
msgstr "``REFUSAL``"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:100
msgid "The model, or a safety system in front of it, declined."
msgstr "模型，或位于它前面的安全系统，拒绝了。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:101 ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:104
msgid "**Withholds tool calls**, ends the request, reports it."
msgstr "**扣下工具调用**，结束请求，并上报。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:102
msgid "``INTERRUPTED``"
msgstr "``INTERRUPTED``"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:103
msgid "Infrastructure ended the response: a provider error, a dropped stream, no capacity."
msgstr "基础设施终止了响应：提供方错误、流中断、容量不足。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:105
msgid "``PAUSED``"
msgstr "``PAUSED``"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:106
msgid "The provider handed control back and wants the turn continued."
msgstr "提供方把控制权交了回来，希望继续这一轮。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:107
msgid "Continues, up to ``Agent.max_pause_continuations`` times (5); reports it only when that runs out."
msgstr "继续，最多 ``Agent.max_pause_continuations`` 次（5 次）；只有次数用尽时才上报。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:108
msgid "``OTHER``"
msgstr "``OTHER``"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:109
msgid "A value this library does not know. ``raw`` has it."
msgstr "本库不认识的取值。\\ ``raw`` 中保留着它。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:110
msgid "Reports it and otherwise carries on."
msgstr "上报它，其余照常进行。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:112
msgid "A new provider value never breaks a run: it becomes ``OTHER`` with the original kept."
msgstr "提供方新增的取值绝不会让运行中断：它会变成 ``OTHER``，并保留原值。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:115
msgid "Tool calls that come with a refusal are not run"
msgstr "随拒绝而来的工具调用不会被运行"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:117
msgid "A refusal can arrive after a complete tool call was already streamed, and an interrupted stream may end in the middle of one. Running that call would act on output the model or the provider disowned. So for ``REFUSAL`` and ``INTERRUPTED`` the calls are removed from the stored message, the tool is never started, and the names of what was withheld are in ``stop.detail[\"withheld_tool_calls\"]``. The provider's own record of the call goes too, because a ``tool_use`` replayed without a result is rejected by the API."
msgstr "拒绝可能在一个完整的工具调用已经流出之后才到来，而被中断的流也可能恰好在某个调用中间结束。运行这样的调用，等于按模型或提供方已经否认的输出行事。因此对于 ``REFUSAL`` 和 ``INTERRUPTED``，这些调用会从存储的消息中移除，工具永远不会启动，被扣下的调用名称保存在 ``stop.detail[\"withheld_tool_calls\"]`` 中。提供方自己记录的该调用也会一并去掉，因为没有结果的 ``tool_use`` 被回放时会被 API 拒绝。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:124
msgid ":download:`Download stop_reasons.py <../_examples/stop_reasons.py>` for a complete, offline program that streams a partial answer and a tool call, refuses, and shows that the tool never ran."
msgstr "完整的离线程序请 :download:`下载 stop_reasons.py <../_examples/stop_reasons.py>`：它先流出一段部分回答和一个工具调用，然后拒绝，并展示工具从未运行。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:133
msgid "Where the reason comes from"
msgstr "原因从哪里来"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:135
msgid "A provider can say it in four ways, and each is read:"
msgstr "提供方可以用四种方式说明，每一种都会被读取："

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:137
msgid "**A value** in ``finish_reason`` or ``stop_reason``. Every provider."
msgstr "**一个取值**，位于 ``finish_reason`` 或 ``stop_reason``\\ 。所有提供方都有。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:138
msgid "**A refusal in the content.** OpenAI's ``refusal`` field and content block. The text is kept and shown like any other answer, and it becomes ``stop.message``. This is the one that used to be lost: such a response finishes with ``stop`` and no text."
msgstr "**内容里的拒绝。** OpenAI 的 ``refusal`` 字段和内容块。文本会被保留，并像其他回答一样展示，同时成为 ``stop.message``\\ 。这正是过去会丢失的那一种：这样的响应以 ``stop`` 结束，而且没有文本。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:141
msgid "**A refusal before any output**, which arrives as an error rather than a stop: a blocked prompt on Google, a ``content_filter`` ``400`` on Kimi, a moderation or guardrail ``403`` on OpenRouter, a policy failure on the OpenAI Responses API. These are answered as a ``REFUSAL`` with an empty message, so the conversation continues and the host is told why. Every other error status still raises as it did."
msgstr "**任何输出之前的拒绝**，它以错误而不是停止的形式到来：Google 上被拦截的提示、Kimi 上 ``content_filter`` 的 ``400``、OpenRouter 上的审核或护栏 ``403``、OpenAI Responses API 上的策略失败。这些会被当作消息为空的 ``REFUSAL`` 来回应，使对话得以继续，并让宿主知道原因。其他所有错误状态仍然像以前一样抛出异常。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:146
msgid "**An error inside a successful stream.** OpenRouter sends one after the ``200`` is committed. With output already written it ends the response as ``INTERRUPTED`` and keeps the text; with none, it is raised as an error, so the usual retry applies."
msgstr "**成功流内部的错误。** OpenRouter 会在 ``200`` 已经提交之后发送这种错误。如果已经有输出，响应会以 ``INTERRUPTED`` 结束并保留文本；如果还没有输出，则会作为错误抛出，因此通常的重试仍然适用。"

