#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:188
msgid "``STOP``, ``MAX_TOKENS``, ``SAFETY``, ``RECITATION``, ``BLOCKLIST``, ``PROHIBITED_CONTENT``, ``SPII``, ``IMAGE_SAFETY``, ``IMAGE_PROHIBITED_CONTENT``, ``IMAGE_RECITATION``; others (``OTHER``, ``MALFORMED_FUNCTION_CALL``, ``LANGUAGE``, ...) are ``OTHER``"
