msgstr "上述结束原因，或者在提示被拦截、没有候选时的 ``prompt_feedback.block_reason``"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:190
msgid "Mistral"
msgstr "Mistral"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:191
msgid "``stop``, ``length``, ``model_length``, ``error``, ``tool_calls``"
