#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:192
msgid "No dedicated value"
msgstr "没有专门的取值"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:193
msgid "Qwen, Groq, xAI, Ollama"
msgstr "Qwen、Groq、xAI、Ollama"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:194
msgid "Qwen documents ``stop``, ``length`` and ``tool_calls``. Groq's and xAI's pages do not list the values. Ollama's ``done_reason`` is an open string."
msgstr "Qwen 在文档中列出了 ``stop``、``length`` 和 ``tool_calls``\\ 。Groq 和 xAI 的页面没有列出取值。Ollama 的 ``done_reason`` 是开放字符串。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:195
msgid "Not documented by the provider"
msgstr "提供方没有在文档中说明"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:197
msgid "Gemini reports ``STOP`` whether or not it called a function, so a step that finished with tool calls is ``TOOL_USE``. ``finishMessage`` is dropped by the Gemini API path of the ``google-genai`` SDK (only Vertex keeps it), so a Google refusal has a category but no sentence."
msgstr "无论是否调用了函数，Gemini 都报告 ``STOP``，所以带着工具调用结束的步骤被视为 ``TOOL_USE``\\ 。\\ ``google-genai`` SDK 的 Gemini API 路径会丢弃 ``finishMessage``\\ （只有 Vertex 会保留），所以 Google 的拒绝只有类别，没有说明文字。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:203
msgid "Choose whether the model reads a refusal again"
msgstr "选择模型是否再次读到被拒绝的回答"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:205
msgid "By default a refused answer stays in the history and is sent again with every later request, like any other assistant message. Anthropic advises treating output produced before a refusal as incomplete and discarding it. Add :class:`~zett_agent.extensions.refusal_replay.RefusalReplayExtension` to choose:"
msgstr "默认情况下，被拒绝的回答会保留在历史中，并随之后每个请求再次发送，与其他助手消息一样。Anthropic 建议把拒绝之前产生的输出视为不完整并丢弃。添加 :class:`~zett_agent.extensions.refusal_replay.RefusalReplayExtension` 来做出选择："

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:216
msgid "Only the request changes. The message stays in stored history and on screen, so changing the setting never rewrites a session. Dropping a message can leave two user messages in a row, and providers differ in whether they accept that, so test it against yours."
msgstr "只有请求会改变。消息仍保留在存储的历史和屏幕上，所以更改设置绝不会改写会话。丢弃一条消息可能导致连续出现两条用户消息，而各个提供方是否接受这种情况并不相同，所以请针对你所用的提供方测试一下。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:221
msgid "Subagents and goals"
msgstr "子智能体与目标"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:223
msgid "A subagent that was refused still returns a message, and its text can be empty or partial. The parent model is told: the report starts with a notice, and ``SubAgentResult.stop`` carries the reason. A background task whose child stopped early is still ``completed``, because the child ended, and says so in ``stop``, in its note, and in the completion notice."
msgstr "被拒绝的子智能体仍然会返回一条消息，它的文本可能为空或不完整。父模型会得到提示：报告以一条通知开头，``SubAgentResult.stop`` 带有原因。子智能体提前停止的后台任务仍然是 ``completed``，因为子智能体已经结束，并会在 ``stop``、它的备注和完成通知中说明这一点。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:228
msgid "A goal is not evaluated against a refused or interrupted answer. Asking the model to try again would only meet the same refusal, so the request ends and the host hears why."
msgstr "目标不会针对被拒绝或被中断的回答进行评估。让模型再试一次只会遇到同样的拒绝，所以请求会结束，宿主也会得知原因。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:232
msgid "What this does not do"
msgstr "它不做什么"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:234
msgid "**No retry on another model.** A refusal is reported, not worked around. Anthropic documents server-side and client-side fallback to a different model; acting on ``stop.recommended_model`` is left to the host."
msgstr "**不会换另一个模型重试。** 拒绝只会被上报，不会被绕过。Anthropic 在文档中介绍了回退到其他模型的服务端和客户端方案；是否依据 ``stop.recommended_model`` 行动，由宿主决定。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:237
msgid "**No removal of a refused turn from the history** unless you choose it above."
msgstr "**除非你按上文选择，否则不会从历史中移除被拒绝的那一轮。**"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:238
msgid "**No guarantee the provider says why.** A refusal with no category and no text is reported as a refusal with nothing to show."
msgstr "**不保证提供方会说明原因。** 没有类别也没有文本的拒绝，会被报告为一个没有任何内容可展示的拒绝。"

#: ../../learn/stop-reasons.rst:241
msgid "Next: :doc:`streaming` for the full event list, or :doc:`providers` to connect one."
msgstr "下一步：参阅 :doc:`streaming` 了解完整的事件列表，或参阅 :doc:`providers` 连接提供方。"

