msgstr "相关 API：:class:`~zett_agent.stop.StopInfo`、:class:`~zett_agent.stop.StopReason`、:class:`~zett_agent.exceptions.AgentStopError`、:class:`~zett_agent.extensions.refusal_replay.RefusalReplayExtension`\\ 。"

